：餐點有水準，但CP值與營運模式令人一整個海綿寶寶】\n\n目前Google 評分準，實際大約是3.5 - 4.0左右。\n\n餐點品質：\n餐點賣相佳，麵條口感優秀扎實、風味不錯，確實是好吃的拉麵。\n\n價位與內容：\n價位偏高（約 $300 多/碗），但內容物偏少，且辣味餐點中居然沒有附溏心蛋，然後肉肉兩片而已... 餐點成本與售價落差較大，內容物份量跟不上定價...\n\n環境與感受：\n桌面空間極小、擁擠 (找個金屬製水桶，可以放在架子上讓大家去取水嘛)。結合先前在林森北店大排長龍動漫迷活動的印象 （差不多也像是蟹堡王那樣的畫面），整體經營風格偏向嚴格控管成本（蟹老闆風格）\n\n優勢/劣勢：\n在人潮擁擠的板橋車站，這家店通常空位較多、不需長時間排隊 (應該算是大家都客滿只有這家空位一堆了)\n\n結論：\n餐點美味但性價比無。如果車站其他餐廳一位難求，這裡不失為一個不用等位的替代選擇\n\n另外：\n小盤子髒髒的\n聯名企劃噱頭給力 💵 動漫宅情義相挺 💪🏻",null,[0,75]]]],[null,1785745753000000,1785745753000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfbjRaT0gtNzNXOHNNVlhRVWFTeHJvdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfbjRaT0gtNzNXOHNNVlhRVWFTeHJvdxoTQ2d3STJhTEIwd1lRdW9YYnVRRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiv0L7F-9mWAxWAh1YBHVhHBz8Q_2MIQSgJ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4301875029726507551/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhWmsxRVNqWmlhMVYzWlZob01WVklRbmhWTVRnMVpIcEdZVTB3UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，\n感謝您蒞臨一風堂板橋環球店